---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AdSenseAd from '../../components/AdSenseAd.astro';

const title = "貓咪老化徵兆：7個預示愛貓進入熟齡期的身體與行為變化";
const description = "你的貓開始老了嗎？解析7個貓咪常見老化徵兆，幫助你在早期階段調整照護方式。";
const publishDate = "2026-05-10";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="mb-8 md:rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514888286974-6c03e2ca1dba?w=1200&h=675&fit=crop&fm=webp"
        alt="老年貓休息"
        class="w-full aspect-video object-cover rounded-2xl"
      />
    </div>

    <header class="mb-10">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">Updated {publishDate} · 10 min read</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight mb-4">{title}</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">{description}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl my-8 text-sm">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-800 mb-2">📌 本篇重點</h3>
      <p>老化是漸進的。了解跳躍力下降、理毛減少等指標，能讓主子在晚年生活更舒適。</p>
    </div>

    <AdSenseAd format="in-article" />

    <section class="prose prose-slate max-w-none mb-10">
      <h2>7個常見的貓咪老化徵兆</h2>
      
      <h3>① 跳躍高度下降</h3>
      <p>這是關節退化（DJD）的警訊。如果貓咪開始猶豫跳上原本喜愛的高處，或需要「階梯」輔助，代表牠需要關節保護了。</p>
      [Image of cat aging signs and behavior changes]

      <h3>② 社交意願降低</h3>
      <p>突然變得很愛躲藏，可能是因為慢性疼痛（如牙病或關節炎）讓牠感到不安。</p>

      <h3>③ 理毛品質下降</h3>
      <p>毛髮變得打結、粗糙。可能是因為身體疼痛讓牠無法扭轉身軀清理背部。</p>

      <AdSenseAd format="in-article" />

      <h3>④ 聽力減退</h3>
      <p>對名字叫喚或開罐頭聲音反應變慢。</p>

      <h3>⑤ 體重異常變化</h3>
      <p>突然變瘦常與甲狀腺亢進或腎臟病有關。建議 7 歲後每半年量一次體重。</p>

      <h3>⑥ 夜間躁動</h3>
      <p>可能與貓癡呆（認知退化）或視力減退有關。</p>

      <h3>⑦ 砂盆意外增加</h3>
      <p>如果貓咪突然在砂盆外如廁，先檢查砂盆入口是否太高，讓牠跨進去會痛。</p>
    </section>

    <div class="bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl my-8">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-red-800 mb-2">⚠️ 需要立即就醫的情況</h3>
      <p class="text-sm">呼吸急促、超過24小時不吃不喝、或突然劇烈嘔吐。</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
      <h3 class="font-bold mb-4">延伸閱讀</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/tools/cat-age-calculator/" class="p-4 bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl font-bold text-indigo-700">貓咪年齡計算機 →</a>
        <a href="/blog/senior-pet-health-guide/" class="p-4 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl font-bold text-purple-700">老年寵物健康指南 →</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>

  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "貓咪老化徵兆：7個身體與行為變化",
    "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Pet Aging Hub" },
    "datePublished": "2026-05-10"
  }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  article h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-top
